      <transcript>SIIDAM</transcript>
      <definition>[= sigidam, sidam] n. Club (a weapon of wood or metal). [Mo.] Short stick reinforced by iron rings and provided on one end with a mass of iron with projecting nipples. It is thrown in hunting hares</definition>
